{"ratings":[{"id":"F1","consequence":"wrong","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A local retry can delete a successful build's output and turn a transient test failure into a blocking failure when setup cleans that output."},{"id":"F2","consequence":"diag","trigger":"plausible","reason":"A retry setup failure is omitted from engine evidence, obscuring why the retry did not run while the original failure still blocks the change."}]}